# Optional. Without it the map uses Esri World Imagery, which needs no account.
# With it the basemap is Mapbox satellite, via the raster tiles API.
# Either way the imagery is display-only: neither licence permits model input.
# Copy to web/.env.local (git-ignored) and fill in.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# Which region to load from web/public/data/. Defaults to webber-greens.
VITE_REGION=
